3:T2f67,<h2><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7065 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cgap-gpt-search.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cgap-gpt-search.jpg 617w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cgap-gpt-search-300x202.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 617px) 100vw, 617px" /></h2>
<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">Good news: All ChatGPT ‘s users now have access to web search!</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Following our recent blog on ChatGPT’s </span><span data-contrast="none">search capabilities in 2024</span><span data-contrast="auto">, it was only available for plus users during its initial phase in October 2024. Well, it&#8217;s now a widespread feature enabled for all logged-in users as well. It&#8217;s fascinating, and informative, and ultimately makes it a significant stride in usefulness and convenience enhancing user experience. Earlier the only thing ChatGPT could not do was live search the web and provide up-to-date information on the latest happenings. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Well, with the number of capabilities unlocked by Open AI and its recent updates this isn&#8217;t entirely shocking. Yes, ChatGPT can now fill you in with all the latest updates and happenings from the web itself. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7060 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image.jpg" alt="" width="797" height="321" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image.jpg 797w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-300x121.jpg 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-768x309.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" />      </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Initially, this feature was available to only the plus users. However, it has recently been integrated for all </span><a href="https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-search/"><span data-contrast="none">logged-in users from 16th December 2024.</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> as well. You can choose the option of either clicking on it or it is a default action based on your search query. It will help you get the latest information on news, sports, maps, stocks, etc.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/chatgpt-o1-model-new-update/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ChatGPT o1- Model- Transforming to Human Capabilities</a></p>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none">What Can the Web Search Feature Do?</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Unlocking significant capabilities and transforming user experience to its best. ChatGPT can now show you your web search results, access the latest information via the web, and provide source links, well what’s even better is it has integrated maps for location-based queries. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7061 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1.jpg" alt="" width="670" height="159" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1.jpg 670w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1-300x71.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" /> </span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Let’s test it out:</h2>
<h3><b><span data-contrast="auto">Test 1- Location-Based Query: </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h3>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Search: “Best Digital Marketing Agency in Thane”? </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Search Result: </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7062 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2.jpg" alt="" width="685" height="523" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2.jpg 685w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-300x229.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px" /></span></p>
<h3>Result:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We were accessed with all the information regarding our search for a </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">digital marketing agency </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">near us. It provided us with a basic overview of the digital marketing agency and their services along with </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">location on maps</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> and source links to verify information.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/chatgpts-ai-search-update-2024-transforming-search-capabilities/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ChatGPT’s AI Search Update 2024: Transforming Search Capabilities</a></p>
<h3>Test 2:</h3>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Trending search:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> Blake lively was in the trending search list</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7063 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-3.jpg" alt="" width="761" height="334" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-3.jpg 761w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-3-300x132.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px" /></span></p>
<h3><span data-contrast="auto">Result: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h3>
<h3><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7064 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-4.jpg" alt="" width="623" height="367" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-4.jpg 623w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-4-300x177.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 623px) 100vw, 623px" /></span></h3>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Explanation: </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">Upon clicking Blake Lively&#8217;s name in the trending search, we were provided with an overview of her information as well as the recent news surrounding her recent lawsuit. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2><b><span data-contrast="auto">Conclusion: Our take on the latest feature</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">A viable solution under one platform enabling search, maps, news, and tools integration with its rising abilities and transformational updates. We are eager to see its newer features and its transformational abilities updated in the coming year, 2025. Tell us which of the updates of OpenAI from 2024 is your favorite one. We shall continue providing our readers with valuable marketing information from the digital world.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Impulse Digital- </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/"><span data-contrast="none">Digital Marketing Agency in Thane</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> provides various digital marketing solutions tailored to your brand and needs. Our team of experts helps strategize and enhance every move for your brand to walk the road to success. To work and collaborate with us reach out to us at: </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us"><span data-contrast="none">https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us</span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
